<main>
	<section id="about" class="leaflet leaflet--about">
		<header class="leaflet-head">
			<p class="eyebrow">Welcome aboard</p>
			<h2>About</h2>
		</header>
		<div class="leaflet-body">
			<p>Hi! I'm Alfie, a Computer Science student at Lancaster University, currently in my second year and really enjoying it.</p>
			<p>I'm the elected Engineering Manager for the student radio station, <a href="https://www.bailriggfm.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">95.3 Bailrigg FM</a>, where I look after the servers and technical equipment that keep us on air. It's a lot of responsibility, but very rewarding.</p>
			<p>Over the summer I did a placement with Network Rail in the Engineering and Asset Management team in Scotland. I sat in on meetings well beyond that remit, including one with contractors on an electrification project, which gave me a broad view of how the UK's railways are managed, maintained and upgraded.</p>
			<p>Right now I'm working through second-year coursework, with this website, Bailrigg FM and other projects on the side.</p>

			<div class="skills">
				<p><strong>Languages:</strong> Python, Java, C/C++, Bash, HTML/CSS, SQL<br>
					<strong>Frameworks:</strong> React, Astro, deck.gl<br>
					<strong>Infrastructure:</strong> Linux, Proxmox, Docker, Pi-hole<br>
					<strong>Hardware &amp; RF:</strong> Raspberry Pi, server maintenance, VHF transmission<br>
					<strong>Other:</strong> Git, OpenStreetMap data, realtime APIs, JetBrains IDEs</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="projects" class="leaflet leaflet--projects">
		<header class="leaflet-head">
			<p class="eyebrow">Service information</p>
			<h2>Projects</h2>
		</header>
		<div class="leaflet-body">
			{projects.map((p) => (
				<article class="project">
					<h3>{p.href ? <a href={p.href}>{p.name}</a> : p.name}</h3>
					<p class="stack">{p.stack}</p>
					<p>{p.text}</p>
					{p.link && <p><a href={p.link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{p.link.label} &rarr;</a></p>}
				</article>
			))}
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="photos" class="leaflet leaflet--photos">
		<header class="leaflet-head">
			<p class="eyebrow">Make a day of it</p>
			<h2>Photographs</h2>
			<span class="sticker" aria-hidden="true">Day<br>out</span>
		</header>
		<div class="leaflet-body">
			<p>Architecture, railways and infrastructure, all shot on my iPhone 17.</p>
			<ul class="gallery">
				{photos.map((photo, i) => (
					<li>
						<figure>
							<Image
								src={photo.asset}
								alt={photo.title}
								width={600}
								quality={85}
								loading={i < 3 ? "eager" : "lazy"}
							/>
							<figcaption>{photo.title}</figcaption>
						</figure>
					</li>
				))}
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="contact" class="leaflet leaflet--contact">
		<header class="leaflet-head">
			<p class="eyebrow">Enquiries &amp; bookings</p>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
		</header>
		<div class="leaflet-body">
			<ul class="coupon">
				<li><span>Email</span><a href="mailto:scroll_cosy_2v@icloud.com">scroll_cosy_2v@icloud.com</a></li>
				<li><span>GitHub</span><a href="https://github.com/Alfie-Sci">github.com/Alfie-Sci</a></li>
				<li><span>LinkedIn</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alfie-ralls-7b80ab386/">linkedin.com/in/alfie-ralls</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>
